  "ai_summary": "AI lab technical postings rose by 374 versus the available July 21 snapshots: OpenAI +276, Anthropic +108, and DeepMind -10. Meanwhile, IT consultancy stocks plunged 32.37% YoY and 21.79% in 30 days, pricing in AI replacing outsourced work. However, Big Tech headcount remains flat (-2.36% YoY), showing no mass AI layoffs. The Indeed Job Postings Index is up 14.98% YoY with steady 30-day gains (+1.23%). Devs aren't broadly cooked, but outsourcing faces structural pressure. The Indeed job postings index is up nearly 15% year-over-year, proving that companies still desperately need humans to clean up after their brilliant AI experiments.",
